TEXT 80 40 Left 2 ;CHUA'S CIRCUIT CHAOTIC OSCILLATOR - AD712 DUAL BiFET OP-AMP REALIZATION

* ========================================================
* SECTION 1: DC POWER SUPPLIES (+9V / -9V)
* ========================================================
TEXT 80 110 Left 2 ;[DC POWER SUPPLIES]

* Vpos (+9V)
SYMBOL voltage 100 180 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Vpos_src
SYMATTR Value 9
WIRE 100 196 100 160
FLAG 100 160 Vpos
WIRE 100 276 100 310
FLAG 100 310 0

* Vneg (-9V)
SYMBOL voltage 100 360 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Vneg_src
SYMATTR Value 9
WIRE 100 376 100 340
FLAG 100 340 0
WIRE 100 456 100 490
FLAG 100 490 Vneg

* ========================================================
* SECTION 2: CHUA RESONANT LC TANK & BIFURCATION RESISTOR
* ========================================================
TEXT 480 110 Left 2 ;[1. RESONANT LC TANK & TUNING RESISTOR]

* Vc1 Node & C1 (10nF)
FLAG 480 180 Vc1
WIRE 480 180 620 180
SYMBOL cap 464 180 R0
SYMATTR InstName C1
SYMATTR Value 10n
SYMATTR SpiceLine ic=0.1
WIRE 480 244 480 290
FLAG 480 290 0

* R_pot (1.75k)
SYMBOL res 604 164 R0
SYMATTR InstName R_pot
SYMATTR Value {Rval}

* Vc2 Node & C2 (100nF)
FLAG 620 260 Vc2
WIRE 620 260 780 260
SYMBOL cap 764 260 R0
SYMATTR InstName C2
SYMATTR Value 100n
SYMATTR SpiceLine ic=0
WIRE 780 324 780 370
FLAG 780 370 0

* L1 (18mH, Rser=12.5)
WIRE 780 260 940 260
SYMBOL ind 924 244 R0
SYMATTR InstName L1
SYMATTR Value 18m
SYMATTR SpiceLine Rser=12.5 ic=0
WIRE 940 340 940 370
FLAG 940 370 0

* ========================================================
* SECTION 3: CHUA DIODE A1 (INNER NEGATIVE RESISTANCE Ga)
* ========================================================
TEXT 1200 110 Left 2 ;[2. CHUA DIODE: INNER SLOPE (A1)]

* Op-Amp U1 (AD712) placed at (1300, 200)
SYMBOL Opamps\\AD712 1300 200 R0
SYMATTR InstName U1
SYMATTR Value AD712
WIRE 1268 280 1200 280
FLAG 1200 280 Vc1
WIRE 1300 232 1300 190
FLAG 1300 190 Vpos
WIRE 1300 296 1300 340
FLAG 1300 340 Vneg
WIRE 1332 264 1400 264
FLAG 1400 264 out1

* In- wire to R1 and R2 (no overlapping text flag!)
WIRE 1268 248 1180 248
WIRE 1180 248 1180 356
SYMBOL res 1164 340 R0
SYMATTR InstName R1
SYMATTR Value 1k
WIRE 1180 436 1180 470
FLAG 1180 470 0

* R2 feedback
WIRE 1180 248 1280 248
WIRE 1280 248 1280 356
SYMBOL res 1264 340 R0
SYMATTR InstName R2
SYMATTR Value 6.5k
WIRE 1280 436 1380 436
WIRE 1380 436 1380 264
WIRE 1380 264 1332 264

* R3 from out1 to Vc1
WIRE 1400 264 1460 264
WIRE 1460 264 1460 356
SYMBOL res 1444 340 R0
SYMATTR InstName R3
SYMATTR Value 18k
WIRE 1460 436 1460 470
FLAG 1460 470 Vc1

* ========================================================
* SECTION 4: CHUA DIODE A2 (OUTER NEGATIVE RESISTANCE Gb)
* ========================================================
TEXT 1800 110 Left 2 ;[3. CHUA DIODE: OUTER SLOPE (A2)]

* Op-Amp U2 (AD712) placed at (1900, 200)
