FLAG 1900 190 Vpos
WIRE 1900 296 1900 340
FLAG 1900 340 Vneg
WIRE 1932 264 2000 264
FLAG 2000 264 out2

* In- wire to R4 and R5
WIRE 1868 248 1780 248
WIRE 1780 248 1780 356
